DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
26437::$$$message_0189_0000_0000$$$::...My heart pounds.[lr]::
26438::$$$message_0189_0000_0001$$$::A clear desire to reach a goal fills my blood.[lr]::
26439::$$$message_0189_0000_0002$$$::"...I see. That's why I came to the shed for no reason."::
26440::$$$message_0189_0001_0000$$$::My body wanted to, whether I knew it or not.[lr]::
26441::$$$message_0189_0001_0001$$$::Go here.[lr]::
26442::$$$message_0189_0001_0002$$$::Recover your past self.[lr]::
26443::$$$message_0189_0001_0003$$$::Know what your weapon is, it urged.[lr]::
26444::$$$message_0189_0001_0004$$$::On some physical level, I knew that I had to do this to fight by Saber's side.::
26445::$$$message_0189_0002_0000$$$::I sit cross-legged and focus my nerves.[lr]::
26446::$$$message_0189_0002_0001$$$::"...Now to see if I can use this well or not."[lr]::
26447::$$$message_0189_0002_0002$$$::How many blanks were there?[lr]::
26448::$$$message_0189_0002_0003$$$::I can't even remember that much, so I might have a hard time activating my Magic Circuits.[lr]::
26449::$$$message_0189_0002_0004$$$::...I'm not confident this will work.[lr]::
26450::$$$message_0189_0002_0005$$$::I concentrated on a point within myself, intending to start from scratch.::
26451::$$$message_0189_0003_0000$$$::It was silly to be so nervous.[lr]::
26452::$$$message_0189_0003_0001$$$::I succeed easily in activating my Magic Circuits and performing Strengthening magecraft.::
26453::$$$message_0189_0004_0000$$$::"...Oh. It was no big deal after all."[lr]::
26454::$$$message_0189_0004_0001$$$::It was anticlimactic, but maybe that's what it feels like for people to overcome a slump.[lr]::
26455::$$$message_0189_0004_0002$$$::Also, this is unexpectedly fascinating.[lr]::
26456::$$$message_0189_0004_0003$$$::For the first time, it felt [font italic=true]fun[font italic=false] to practice and use magecraft.::
26457::$$$message_0189_0005_0000$$$::...I can finally move forward.[lr]::
26458::$$$message_0189_0005_0001$$$::I think of a sniper I shouldn't have seen yet.[lr]::
26459::$$$message_0189_0005_0002$$$::I finally remember my weapon.[lr]::
26460::$$$message_0189_0005_0003$$$::Tonight, I'll hone my power as much as time allows...::
926445::$$$message_9189_0002_0000$$$::I sit cross-legged and focus my nerves.[r]::

